89:raises M_W. Hence:
93:- White makes at most M_W(X) moves and Black at most M_B(X), in any sequence of moves by either side.
300:BIG > max(M_W(X), M_B(X)). Then
320:move in a live component, and Right has at most M_B(Y) moves in total. Left needs at most M_B(Y) + 1 moves and
321:has at least BIG ≥ M_B(Y) + 1. Right runs out first.
